<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>MONSTER BEVERAGE DECLARES TWO-FOR-ONE STOCK
SPLIT</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in"><B>Corona, CA</B> &ndash; July&nbsp;8, 2026 &ndash;
Monster Beverage Corporation (NASDAQ: MNST) today&#8239;announced that its Board of Directors has approved and declared a 2-for-1 split of its
common stock that will be effected in the form of a 100% stock dividend. Each stockholder of record on July&nbsp;24, 2026 will receive
a dividend of one additional share of common stock for each then-held share, to be distributed after close of trading on August&nbsp;10,
2026. The Company anticipates its common stock to begin trading at the split-adjusted price on August&nbsp;11, 2026.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Monster Beverage Corporation</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 0.5in">Based in Corona, California, Monster Beverage Corporation
is a holding company and conducts no operating business except through its consolidated subsidiaries. The Company&rsquo;s subsidiaries
develop and market energy drinks, including Monster Energy&reg; drinks, Monster Energy Ultra&reg; energy drinks, Juice Monster&reg; and
Punch Monster&reg; Energy + Juice energy drinks, Java Monster&reg; and Monster Killer Brew&reg; non-carbonated coffee + energy drinks,
Rehab&reg; Monster&reg; non-carbonated energy drinks, Monster Energy&reg; Nitro energy drinks, Reign Total Body Fuel&reg; high performance
energy drinks, Reign Storm&reg; and Storm&trade; total wellness energy drinks, NOS&reg; energy drinks, Full Throttle&reg; energy drinks,
Bang Energy&reg; drinks, FLRT&trade; total wellness energy drinks, BPM&reg; energy drinks, BU&reg; energy drinks, Burn&reg; energy drinks,
Live+&reg; energy drinks, Mother&reg; energy drinks, Nalu&reg; energy drinks, Play&reg; and Power Play&reg; (stylized) energy drinks,
Relentless&reg; energy drinks, Samurai&reg; energy drinks, Ultra Energy&reg; drinks, Predator&reg; energy drinks and Fury&reg; energy
drinks. The Company&rsquo;s subsidiaries also develop and market craft beers, flavored malt beverages and hard seltzers under a number
of brands, including Jai Alai&reg; IPA, Dale&rsquo;s Pale Ale&reg;, Dallas Blonde&reg;, Wild Basin&reg; hard seltzers, The Beast&trade;,
Beast&reg; Tea, Blind Lemon&reg; and Blinder Lemon&trade;. For more information visit <U>www.monsterbevcorp.com</U>.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">(more)</P>

